  "lineExcessAt14dCaveat": "THE CARRIER SET IS SELECTED BY THE PILOT. The 208 east-west and 56 north-south carriers are exactly the GEO payloads whose PILOT peaks landed inside the 14 d core, so a line excess computed on them is circular in the pilot's favour and is reported only as a consistency read, never as a detection. The same-shell GEO passive control is NOT selected, so the control rows are the ones that carry weight; and the per-window paired gain below compares two templates on the SAME window and is not affected by which windows were chosen.",
